Verification
============

Run in the workshop image ghcr.io/jbris/open-reproducible-science-r:1.0.0
under R 4.4.1:

  - Full dataset: 29 studies, pooled r = 0.363 (95% CI 0.309 to 0.415).
  - General population: 18 studies, pooled r = 0.379 (95% CI 0.299 to 0.454).
  - The template pipeline lacks exactly two edges: studies -> fit and
    result -> summary_file.
  - A rerun skips all 7 targets, and a full rebuild produces an identical
    summary.
  - Changing the tau estimator rebuilds only fit, result and summary_file.
  - quarto render --to all builds the HTML and PDF and exits with 0.
  - The R parse check passed for 7 of 7 scripts, and git diff --check is
    clean.

Pending: human review (see AI_POLICY.md), a timed rehearsal, and a test in a
fresh MyBinder launch. Codex and Claude Code assisted with the revision; agent
verification is not human review.


