+Every later stage of the workshop is a tracked text file: the lockfile,
+metadata templates, the pipeline, and the report. Their changes can be reviewed
+like any other code. Generated outputs, caches, and your personal workspace
+copies are ignored by Git, because they can be recreated from the tracked
+files. The raw data file is tracked, together with its checksum.
